            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Don't worry, we all have been learning some day.\r\n\r\nYes, **if** users need tree-sitter or LSP powered functionality they are expected to install it themselves. This is not (yet) a pre-configured distribution like LazyVim.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Don't worry, we all have been learning some day.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, <strong>if</strong> users need tree-sitter or LSP powered functionality they are expected to install it themselves. This is not (yet) a pre-configured distribution like LazyVim.</p>",
